{
  "name": "flood_monitoring_bundle",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "title": "郁江双期水体变化与质量分析",
  "description": "一次OGE服务计算，返回21波段数值成果。渲染、点查、圈选统计复用成果，不重复计算。",
  "parameters": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "coverageID": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "myData/guigang_20260712_optical10m_yujiang_v1.tif",
        "pattern": "^myData/[^\\s]+$"
      },
      "beforeCoverageID": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "myData/guigang_20260622_optical10m_yujiang_v1.tif",
        "pattern": "^myData/[^\\s]+$"
      },
      "swirPath": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "myData/guigang_20260712_swir20m_yujiang_v1.tif",
        "pattern": "^myData/[^\\s]+$"
      },
      "beforeSwirPath": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "myData/guigang_20260622_swir20m_yujiang_v1.tif",
        "pattern": "^myData/[^\\s]+$"
      },
      "sclPath": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "myData/guigang_20260712_scl20m_yujiang_v1.tif",
        "pattern": "^myData/[^\\s]+$"
      },
      "beforeSclPath": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "myData/guigang_20260622_scl20m_yujiang_v1.tif",
        "pattern": "^myData/[^\\s]+$"
      },
      "poiRasterPath": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "myData/guigang_yujiang_poi10m_v1.tif",
        "pattern": "^myData/[^\\s]+$"
      },
      "poiMaxId": {
        "type": "integer",
        "default": 30,
        "minimum": 1,
        "maximum": 65535
      },
      "ndwiThreshold": {
        "type": "number",
        "default": 0.0,
        "minimum": -1,
        "maximum": 1
      },
      "mndwiThreshold": {
        "type": "number",
        "default": 0.0,
        "minimum": -1,
        "maximum": 1
      },
      "thresholdStep": {
        "type": "number",
        "default": 0.05,
        "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
        "maximum": 1
      },
      "reflectanceScale": {
        "type": "number",
        "default": 0.0001,
        "exclusiveMinimum": 0
      },
      "targetCrs": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "EPSG:32649",
        "const": "EPSG:32649"
      },
      "resolution": {
        "type": "number",
        "default": 10.0,
        "const": 10.0
      },
      "outputName": {
        "type": "string",
        "default": "yujiang_flood_analysis",
        "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{1,80}$"
      }
    }
  },
  "limitations": [
    "默认输入为2026-06-22与2026-07-12，不能代表洪峰最大淹没范围。",
    "阈值为未校准基线，九组一致性不代表精度、概率或实际损失。",
    "SWIR/SCL重采样为10米不增加原始空间细节。",
    "仅支持已核查的EPSG:32649、同原点、同范围数据；替换数据前必须核查元数据。",
    "关注点ID栅格可能只包含部分点；不能用poiMaxId充当点位数量。"
  ],
  "presentation": {
    "bands": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "name": "change_class",
        "title": "双期水体变化",
        "description": "共同有效观测且两指数一致时划分稳定非水体、持续水体、新增与退水；分歧和无效观测单独编码。新增水体不等同于已核实洪涝。",
        "unit": null
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "name": "quality_class",
        "title": "观测质量",
        "description": "0双方有效；1仅灾前无效；2仅灾后无效；3双方无效。有效要求SCL为4/5/6、参与指数波段为正且指数在[-1,1]。",
        "unit": null
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "name": "before_water",
        "title": "灾前水体",
        "description": "1表示灾前水体，0表示不满足；NoData表示本产品不可判定。",
        "unit": null
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "name": "after_water",
        "title": "灾后水体",
        "description": "1表示灾后水体，0表示不满足；NoData表示本产品不可判定。",
        "unit": null
